  "accepted_answers": [
    "Green River",
    "Snake River"
  ],
  "explanation": "The question asks 'What river does Henrys Fork flow into?' and requires identifying the correct recipient river(s). From the original sources:\n\n- **D1S1** explicitly states that Henrys Fork is a tributary of the Green River in Utah and Wyoming.\n- **D3S1** identifies Henrys Fork as a tributary of the Snake River in southeastern Idaho.\n\nThese two distinct geographic contexts describe separate rivers named Henrys Fork — one in Utah/Wyoming (Green River tributary), and one in Idaho (Snake River tributary). Both are valid and distinct referents. The claim in **D2S6** that Henrys Fork flows into the Mississippi River is unsupported by any other source and contradicts the clear tributary relationships described in D1S1 and D3S1. Therefore, it is excluded."
}
